{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/6d0d16ae453634eac81afe26affd6052.poster.avif?t=1772813101\" width=800 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/6d0d16ae453634eac81afe26affd6052.webm?t=1772813101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A la Card</i> is a <strong>food truck deckbuilding roguelike</strong>\u00a0where you'll mix and match the best aspects of every card you find to create\u00a0<strong>absurd synergies\u00a0</strong>and make new discoveries every time you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/c9af07393632b3621b2cfbd553995f94.poster.avif?t=1772813101\" width=1170 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/c9af07393632b3621b2cfbd553995f94.webm?t=1772813101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stick the effect of one food onto another</strong>. Change what triggers that effect in the first place. Swap stats, inherit flavours, and\u00a0<strong>cook up clever combinations no one else will</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/08910b206b6d9424ecd975c94635e506.poster.avif?t=1772813101\" width=750 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/08910b206b6d9424ecd975c94635e506.webm?t=1772813101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is an ebb and flow of cramming as many calories as possible into the window before hittin' the road to slap together the most <strong>powerful cards\u00a0</strong>you can conceive of. These people want food? <i>Oh you'll give them food.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/e767f309aa1c92c445192a4e0110f715.avif?t=1772813101\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won't be enough to just make a really big burger. <strong>Zany bosses</strong> bring self-contained puzzles to navigate, testing your deck's flexibility. They'll slip you a card and refuse to leave until you serve it to them or clog the window with half-eaten scrap. <strong>You'd better be able to improvise</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Served with a garnish of <strong>tasty tunes</strong> made to order by Josh Whelchel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/a6b86ca913e4a027abd60ad7e8514539.avif?t=1772813101\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sequence your cards</strong> to make the most of their effects. Skilled players are rewarded for clever plays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the calories of your ingredients using <strong>powerful recipes</strong>, creating space to serve even more food! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random special events</strong> provide opportunities to change each and every detail of your cards: the colours, calories, effects, how you trigger those effects, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each starting deck has a <strong>unique and powerful trinket</strong> that deeply impacts how it plays, and you'll <strong>find more trinkets</strong> to mix and match throughout your runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presiding over each location is a <strong>memorable boss with a unique ability</strong>. When big numbers aren't enough, you'll have to get creative! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win runs to <strong>unlock more</strong> starting decks, trinkets, and release even more cards into the pool for future runs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit your favourite decks to take on <strong>special challenges</strong> and earn coveted stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>hundreds of cards</strong> and <strong>dozens upon dozens of mid-game events and upgrades,</strong> no two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/f4198992df802d61d5ac3c64cc36b825.avif?t=1772813101\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Works","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180680/5fa74104c27239c279733c07e3a657f8ebbe53d3.jpg"},{"name":"Hometown Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180680/98b78e232f2c0f5efc254c47cbd1aafe3725491a.jpg"},{"name":"Burger Royalty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180680/abf6ab759b5305f3e3a4c9e0a55543605d5321b3.jpg"},{"name":"Hero Dreams of Sushi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180680/b3000aee5e10c9941740e72c071f7157539b51f0.jpg"},{"name":"I Scream I Just Scream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180680/d8f9791a8e39470dc39a46296cf1191f6fc386ca.jpg"},{"name":"Something to Taco 'bout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180680/d7f016e32ee3e703f4e7b57b52c539fcde707275.jpg"},{"name":"You Wanna Pizza This","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180680/13f9a5d50b1c1423614950df55ee2800fd79282f.jpg"},{"name":"Nothin' Gets Pasta Ya","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180680/b66c2dec4967dde227d13d4451a57f6daae94a34.jpg"},{"name":"Smokin' Hot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180680/34e66af6f460b906d008399b929a9614981ce441.jpg"},{"name":"Do Drink Your Calories","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180680/c013a9392c1ed0f91a6ddf7ee217a9000ce934f9.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3180680?t=1772813101","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772813101","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/2e66d51b941ea35c6eb1ab919e02120cf8e973a0/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1772813101","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/2e66d51b941ea35c6eb1ab919e02120cf8e973a0/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1772813101","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/6d0d16ae453634eac81afe26affd6052.poster.avif?t=1772813101\" width=800 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/6d0d16ae453634eac81afe26affd6052.webm?t=1772813101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A la Card</i> is a <strong>food truck deckbuilding roguelike</strong>\u00a0where you'll mix and match the best aspects of every card you find to create\u00a0<strong>absurd synergies\u00a0</strong>and make new discoveries every time you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/c9af07393632b3621b2cfbd553995f94.poster.avif?t=1772813101\" width=1170 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/c9af07393632b3621b2cfbd553995f94.webm?t=1772813101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stick the effect of one food onto another</strong>. Change what triggers that effect in the first place. Swap stats, inherit flavours, and\u00a0<strong>cook up clever combinations no one else will</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/08910b206b6d9424ecd975c94635e506.poster.avif?t=1772813101\" width=750 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/08910b206b6d9424ecd975c94635e506.webm?t=1772813101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is an ebb and flow of cramming as many calories as possible into the window before hittin' the road to slap together the most <strong>powerful cards\u00a0</strong>you can conceive of. These people want food? <i>Oh you'll give them food.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/e767f309aa1c92c445192a4e0110f715.avif?t=1772813101\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won't be enough to just make a really big burger. <strong>Zany bosses</strong> bring self-contained puzzles to navigate, testing your deck's flexibility. They'll slip you a card and refuse to leave until you serve it to them or clog the window with half-eaten scrap. <strong>You'd better be able to improvise</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Served with a garnish of <strong>tasty tunes</strong> made to order by Josh Whelchel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/a6b86ca913e4a027abd60ad7e8514539.avif?t=1772813101\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sequence your cards</strong> to make the most of their effects. Skilled players are rewarded for clever plays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the calories of your ingredients using <strong>powerful recipes</strong>, creating space to serve even more food! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random special events</strong> provide opportunities to change each and every detail of your cards: the colours, calories, effects, how you trigger those effects, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each starting deck has a <strong>unique and powerful trinket</strong> that deeply impacts how it plays, and you'll <strong>find more trinkets</strong> to mix and match throughout your runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presiding over each location is a <strong>memorable boss with a unique ability</strong>. When big numbers aren't enough, you'll have to get creative! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win runs to <strong>unlock more</strong> starting decks, trinkets, and release even more cards into the pool for future runs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit your favourite decks to take on <strong>special challenges</strong> and earn coveted stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>hundreds of cards</strong> and <strong>dozens upon dozens of mid-game events and upgrades,</strong> no two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/extras/f4198992df802d61d5ac3c64cc36b825.avif?t=1772813101\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["Shook Loose"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180680/37db601da62b64ea3a25c9549f65a85ef16bd470/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1772813101","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3180680/569710769/366ba475fe3ae3548a288debe26e17d8d406128d/1764542911/dash_av1.m